This repository packages and enriches geographic data from external sources.
The following notices apply in addition to the MIT license above:

1. Country and subdivision hierarchy
   Source: country-regions/country-region-data
   https://github.com/country-regions/country-region-data
   License: MIT

2. Enrichment metadata (capitals, phone codes, currencies, and related fields)
   Source: dr5hn/countries-states-cities-database
   https://github.com/dr5hn/countries-states-cities-database
   License: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
   Attribution is required when redistributing or deriving from this metadata.
   See: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

3. ISO 3166-1 codes, names, and flag emoji construction
   Derived from publicly available ISO 3166-1 data and Unicode regional
   indicator symbols. No additional copyright is claimed over standard codes
   or Unicode characters.

Users who redistribute the capital / phone / currency enrichment derived from
the ODbL-licensed source must comply with ODbL attribution and share-alike
requirements for that portion of the data.
